# Vehicle HAL Adapter

Android Automotive vehicle-platform subsystem covering Binder-facing car services, vehicle HAL
transport and value mapping, platform APIs, compatibility behavior, and focused tests. Soong and
platform API inputs are required from an AAOS/AOSP product tree for a complete build.
